OMP Honcho Memory

This project is derived from @citywalki/oh-my-pi-honcho-memory version 0.2.0.
The npm package metadata identifies citywalki as the author and declares the
original package under the MIT License. The repository URL recorded by that
package was unavailable when this derivative repository was prepared.

Substantial changes in this derivative include:
- exact configured peer identity preservation;
- native OMP chat-instance session mapping;
- serialized and acknowledged turn persistence;
- bounded raw workspace recall with provenance handling;
- lifecycle-aware flush and compaction behavior;
- transient bilingual runtime notifications.

No private configuration, API credentials, session transcripts, cloud exports,
or user-specific identity values are included in this repository.
